### Terraform (infra/) ###
# Provider binaries downloaded by terraform init: large and rebuilt from the lock file.
**/.terraform/
# State and its backups describe every created resource and may hold secrets (e.g. the generated DB password).
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# Saved plans ("terraform plan -out") embed the same sensitive values as the state.
*.tfplan
# Per-developer variable values; only the documented *.tfvars.example is versioned.
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored: it pins provider versions and checksums for everyone.

### Kubernetes ###
# Cluster credentials written by the kind provider or exported from EKS.
kubeconfig*
# Input of the Kustomize secretGenerator; only secrets.env.example is versioned.
k8s/overlays/*/secrets.env
# Developer public IP for the AWS load balancer; only allowed-cidr.yaml.example is versioned.
k8s/overlays/aws/allowed-cidr.yaml
